  "market_commentary": {
    "overview": "",
    "bulkers": "Although this week felt slow, especially with China closed today due to Dragon Boat festival \nholidays, we recorded a total of 12 deals, comprising 1 Capesize, 1 post-panamax, 1 Kamsarmax, 2 \nPanamax, 2 Supramax, and 5 Handysize bulk carriers.  \n \nFollowing the post-Posidonia surge in transactions, ships values have remained highly resilient at \nmulti-year highs, but a softening freight market has induced some short-term caution. For a detailed \nreview and additional information regarding these transactions, kindly refer to our \"representative \nsales\" section.",
    "demolition": "Bangladesh remains firm after local budget government announcement, Pakistan remains \nstable at high levels, India is down due to rainy season, Turkey has softened due to the seasonal \nslowdown during the summer period. For an overview of demolition market rates, please check our \ncomprehensive demometer below:"
